Most studios won't tell you a price until you call. We think that wastes your time, so here is exactly what wedding photography costs with us in 2026–27, and what changes the price.

## The short answer

Our wedding packages cost **₹49,999 to ₹1,99,999**. Every package includes full HD photos and video, a highlights video, a printed 14×40 album with a leather cover, two 43-inch LED screens at the venue and a 64 GB pendrive.

| Package | Price | What it adds |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Silver | ₹49,999 | 2-day coverage, 50-sheet album |
| Gold | ₹69,999 | Candid on the wedding day, teaser, designed album |
| Platinum | ₹99,999 | Drone, cinematic film, 8×12 ft LED wall |
| Diamond | ₹1,24,999 | Ring ceremony, two albums, extra cameramen |
| Prime | ₹1,49,999 | Premium paper, two extra cameramen |
| Exclusive | ₹1,99,999 | Every function for 3 days, pre-wedding included |

## What changes the price

1. **How many days and functions you want covered.** A two-day wedding needs less than a three-day one with haldi, mehendi and sangeet.
2. **Candid and cinematic coverage.** Gold to Prime include them on the wedding day. Extra days cost ₹11,999 (candid) or ₹12,499 (cinematic) per day.
3. **Venue tech.** An 8×12 ft LED wall is ₹9,999 as an add-on, and a YouTube live stream for family abroad is ₹9,999.
4. **Travel.** Outside Rohtak, travel and stay for the team are added, and we quote them before you book.

## Three real examples

- **Simple two-day wedding in Rohtak:** Silver, ₹49,999.
- **Wedding with candid photos and a drone:** Gold + drone = ₹77,998.
- **Grand wedding with a cinematic film and LED wall:** Platinum, ₹99,999. Bought separately on Gold, those extras would cost ₹30,497 more.

## How to book

You reserve your date with 25% of the total. The rest is paid in two parts: 50% on the event day and 25% before final delivery.

The quickest way to see your exact number is our [quote builder](/build): pick a package, add what you need, and send the quote to us or to your family on WhatsApp.
